cff-version: 1.2.0
title: ReadAligner
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
abstract: >-
  A command-line tool for aligning short sequencing reads to a reference
  genome. It is tuned for low-coverage clinical samples, where standard
  aligners lose sensitivity, and emits both BAM and CRAM output with
  per-region quality summaries.
authors:
